otm-monaco.img — OpenTopoMap Monaco fixture
============================================

This IMG file is a derivative work containing two distinct layers, each
under a different licence:

1. Map data
   -----------
   Source: OpenStreetMap contributors.
   Licence: Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0.
   Full text: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
   Attribution: © OpenStreetMap contributors.

2. Style / cartographic rendering
   ------------------------------
   Source: OpenTopoMap (https://opentopomap.org/).
   Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
            (CC-BY-SA 4.0).
   Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
   Attribution: Map style © OpenTopoMap (CC-BY-SA).

Redistribution within this repository is permitted under both licences
provided the attributions above are preserved. The file is included here
solely as a small, deterministic test fixture for the `kmp-garmin-img`
parser; it is not redistributed for end-user mapping use.

The build pipeline (mkgmap) is LGPL-3.0; the binary IMG output of mkgmap
does not itself carry the LGPL — that licence applies only to the mkgmap
tool, not to the maps produced by it.
